  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Page No.# 1/2 vs The State Of Assam on 22 October, 2024 Author: Manash Ranjan Pathak Bench: Manash Ranjan Pathak Page No.# 1/2 GAHC010198842024 THE GAUHATI HIGH COURT (HIGH COURT OF ASSAM, NAGALAND, MIZORAM AND ARUNACHAL PRADESH) Case No. : AB/2564/2024 NUR ALMINA KHATUN AND ANR W/O SHAHADAT ALI R/O NO. 1 GARUGAON P.S. MANIKPUR DIST. BONGAIGAON, ASSAM 2: ASMOT ALI S/O ABDUL CHABUR R/O GARUGAON P.S. MANIKPUR DIST. BONGAIGAON ASSA VERSUS THE STATE OF ASSAM REP BY THE PP, ASSAM Advocate for the Petitioner : MR. A AHMED, MR A AHMED,U U KHAN,MR. M A CHOUDHURY Advocate for the Respondent : PP, ASSAM, Page No.# 2/2 BEFORE HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE MANASH RANJAN PATHAK 22/10/2024 Heard Mr. U U Khan, learned counsel for the petitioners and Mr. P Borthakur, learned Additional Public Prosecutor, Assam for the State respondent. The petitioners, namely, (1) Nur Almina Khatun and (2) Asmot Ali, have filed this application under Section 482 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, seeking pre-arrest bail apprehending Page No.# 1/2 vs The State Of Assam on 22 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/29663941/ 1 their arrest in Abhayapuri P.S. Case No. 211/2024 registered under Sections 303(2)/112 of BNS, read with Section 59(II) of Food Safety and Standards Act.",
